        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you...\r\n\r\n2 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom Apartment \r\nDual Balconies\r\nParking \r\nCentral Location \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present Apartment 179 Crosbies Yard to the Dublin 3 property market.\r\nApartment 179, Crosbie's Yard, Ossory Road, Dublin 3, is a spacious and light-filled two-bedroom apartment ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development in the heart of Dublin 3. Perfectly situated along the Royal Canal and within easy walking distance of both Dublin City Centre and the Clontarf seafront, this superb property offers the perfect balance of city convenience and coastal living.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a welcoming entrance hall provides access to two generous storage rooms, offering excellent practicality and additional space rarely found in apartment living. The accommodation opens into a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, where large windows and a south-west facing aspect allow natural light to flood the space throughout the day. The living area opens directly onto a substantial private balcony overlooking the Royal Canal, creating a wonderful setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the tranquil waterside views.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen is thoughtfully designed with an abundance of base and eye-level cabinetry, complemented by granite worktops and ample preparation space, making it both stylish and functional.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the apartment are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both benefiting from direct access to a second private balcony of impressive proportions. Extending to approximately 25 sq.m, this outdoor space provides a rare and valuable extension of the living accommodation and enjoys a peaceful setting away from the main living areas. A large contemporary bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from a designated parking space and well-maintained communal grounds, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nCrosbie's Yard enjoys an enviable location close to a host of amenities. The nearby villages of Fairview and Clontarf offer an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, supermarkets and recreational facilities, while the Clontarf Promenade provides miles of scenic coastal walks and cycle routes. The IFSC, East Point Business Park, Dublin Docklands and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible, making this a highly convenient address for commuters.\r\n\r\nTransport links in the area are excellent, with numerous Dublin Bus routes, Clontarf Road DART Station, Connolly Station and the LUAS Red Line all within easy reach. Dublin Airport, the Port Tunnel, M1 and M50 motorways are also readily accessible. The area is well served by a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, together with a range of third-level institutions, further enhancing the appeal of this outstanding location.\r\n\r\nCombining generous living accommodation, exceptional outdoor space and a prime Dublin 3 address, Apartment 179 represents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of the city's most desirable residential developments.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
